73	     * schema {@code @Pattern} (checked above, so a malformed value is already a {@code postcode}
74	     * error). When it is well-formed it must also be in range for the region derived from the
75	     * owner's city (NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099); a city with no known region
76	     * accepts any 4-digit postcode. An out-of-range postcode is a {@code postcode} error (400).
